==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|bíða|lang=non}}, from {{proto|Germanic|bīdanan|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈpiːða/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|iːða|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|beið|biðu|beðið}}

# {{intransitive}} to [[wait]]
#: '''''Bíddu''' eftir mér!''
#:: '''Wait''' for me!
#: '''''Bíddu'''!''
#:: '''Wait'''!
# {{transitive|governs the genitive}} to [[wait for]] something{{jump|is|wait for|s}}
#: '''''Bíddu''' mín.''
#:: '''Wait for''' me.

